```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "decide an orphaned promotion: keep it or drop it, by the hand"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.offer.orphans"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.offer.orphans"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.offer.orphans"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.offer.orphans ~ the hand keeps or drops what lost its source

Every wiki wears promotion capability; its edge holds (face, wiki, digest). The AI prepares and flags; the hand commits and raises. The wiki rides `wiki=` (absent: the daemon wiki), the face `face=N`, and every answer prints as JSON.

`trust orphan <digest> keep=true|drop=true` decides a promoted item whose source went away: `keep=true` keeps it standing, `drop=true` drops it. Name one, never both or neither. A person runs it at a real terminal.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ keep-it · drop-it

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`keep-it` params=`digest/<digest> keep ~ keep the orphan`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`drop-it` params=`digest/<digest> drop ~ drop the orphan`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ digest · wiki · face · keep · drop

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`digest` params=`takes/hex64 needs/required seat/1 as/<digest> ~ the promotion's digest, 64 lowercase hex`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wiki` params=`takes/wiki-name ~ the wiki the promotion belongs to; absent, the daemon wiki`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ which face's promotion plane this call reads or acts on, by persona index (a whole number from 0)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`keep` params=`~ keep the orphan standing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`drop` params=`~ drop the orphan`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand ~ a hand alone decides: an AI harness refuses promote-needs-hand, naming the command the operator runs`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ promote-decision-malformed · promote-digest-malformed · promote-needs-hand

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`promote-decision-malformed` params=`cure/[[realm.offer.orphans digest/<digest> keep]] ~ name keep=true or drop=true, one of them`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`promote-digest-malformed` params=`cure/[[realm.offer.orphans digest/<digest> keep]] ~ name a hex64 digest`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`promote-needs-hand` params=`cure/[[realm.offer.reads]] ~ a hand must decide`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ decided

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`decided` params=`exit/0 ~ the orphan stands kept or dropped; the answer prints as JSON`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares trust orphan

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares trust orphan]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

